        {
            "name": "rigidity",
            "statement": "34 arms attached at one upward crossover each change no response of C-0009's grillage",
            "verdict": "PASS — the peak dishing under C-0022's solved load moves from 1.070841 nm to 1.070841 nm, a departure of 7.8e-10, which is the arm regularisation and vanishes with it"
        },
